   "section": "Upper Division Electives",
   "rule": {
    "type": "manual",
    "text": "Students must complete a minimum of 15 units of upper division coursework in the College of Engineering.\nComplete any College of Engineering 100-193 course, excluding:\n- BIOENG 100, 153\n- COMPSCI 194-100\n- DESINV courses (except 190E)\n- ENGIN 125, 157AC, 170 series, 180, 183 series, 184, 185, 187, 188, 195 series\n- INDENG 185, 186, 190 series, 191, 192, 195\n- MECENG 190K, 191K.",
